units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p f
atom_style atomic
lattice bcc 3.3008
region projectile block 0 20 0 20 0 20 units lattice
region target block 0 20 0 20 21.5 61.5 units lattice
region total block 0 20 0 20 0 61.5 units lattice
create_box 2 total
create_atoms 1 region projectile
create_atoms 2 region target
mass 1 92.90638
mass 2 92.90638
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * /home/holbrooe/LAMMPS-AST/publication/potentials/prompt3.potential Nb Nb
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
velocity all create 300.0 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
timestep 0.001
fix 1 all nvt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal press
run 10
velocity all create 300.0 54321 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
group proj region projectile
group targ region target
velocity proj set 0.0 0.0 20.0 units box sum yes
fix 2 all nve
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal press
dump 1 all custom 1000 spall.dump id type x y z vx vy vz
run 10
